// forsaken-styx — преисподняя in A minor, 60 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style hell, seed 3): врата → лимб → город Дит → Стикс → спуск → девятый круг → пепел.
// Themes: A — Dies Irae (день гнева, секвенция XIII века) (as written), B — Lake of Fire (огненное озеро) (as written); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from kawaii. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
